 "notes": [
  "cold-only (--cold-only): ONE synchronized call per workload -- the merged-graph compile of that workload's plan -- with no warmup and no timed reps, so every warm field is null and samples_ms is [] (NOT a measured 0): median_ms / min_ms / max_ms / mean_ms and stage_ms were not measured, first_call_ms / digest / stage_first_call / band_report / validation were",
  "the pool width and the banded+chunked composition are CONFIG knobs (EVOGP_BATCH_COMPILE_WORKERS / EVOGP_BATCH_CHUNK_BANDS), so each record states the merge shape it ran instead of inheriting one",
  "record['validation'] is keyed by workload name: one compare(oracle, engine) block per workload, computed AFTER the timed window on the first --max-oracle rows (oracle = src/evogp/tests/reference_eval.py), so a cross-config comparison reads validation[workload].bitwise_equal / max_abs / oracle_digest",
  "band_report.cost_estimate / flat_estimate read null unless EVOGP_BATCH_BANDS=auto ran the static cost model -- a pinned band size or the flat merge never runs it, so null (NOT 0) is the expected value there, and band_requested / band_requested_bands / band_clamped / band_note / band_policy state what the model chose and whether the binding policy lowered it"
 ],
